[{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0010","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0020","text":"～♪"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0030","text":"来，冬优子酱也给你一份～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0040","text":"哎呀，谢谢\n正好想要呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0050","text":"啊哈哈～，太好了～\n……那个，是在搜自己的名字～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0060","text":"嗯。上次那本杂志，今天发售嘛\n你的也顺便看看？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0070","text":"哦，可以吗！？\n谢啦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0080","text":"两位，跟我一起来一下嘛！\n我在外面发现了超有趣的东西！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0090","text":"哦！什么什么！我去！\n我一个人就够了呗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0100","text":"好的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0110","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0120","text":"……呼……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0130","text":"……呵呵～\\n"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0140","text":"……辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0150","text":"啊哈哈，这点小事没什么啦\n倒是你搜得怎么样？有好的评论吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0160","text":"有啊\n不过，光看好评论可不行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0170","text":"──比起那个\n你跑来跑去的，不渴吗？要喝茶吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0180","text":"不用不用！我自己去买就──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0190","text":"──抱歉，还是拜托你了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_05050000_03_0200","text":"明白"}]
